{"MountainReport":{"MRID":12362,"SkyB":32,"SkyBText":"sunny","SkyS":32,"SkySText":"sunny","MetricToday":0,"MetricOvernight":1,"Metric24hours":1,"Metric48hours":10,"Metric3days":10,"Metric7days":10,"MetricAlpineSnowDepth":146,"BaseCond":"","SummCond":"","BaseTemp":"-4","SummTemp":"-10","BaseWinds":"3","SummWinds":"3","BaseVis":"Good","SummVis":"Excellent","Runs":"0","Acres":"0","Groomedruns":"","Notes":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eGood morning everyone and welcome back to another beautiful day here at RED Mountain. The long weekend continues here at RED with another gorgeous Rossland Sunday. Better pack your sunglasses, as sunny skies are expected to brighten up your day on the hill! Be sure to dress warm for the morning, as conditions remain crisp before the mountain heats up in the afternoon sun.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e On hill visibility is currently good at lower elevations, with any lingering low hanging clouds expected to dissipate towards the afternoon. Excellent visibility at higher elevations, with photo-op worthy views available of the West Kootenays from the summit. Be sure to stop by the party at \u003c/span\u003e\u003cu style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.redresort.com/dining/#paradise\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eParadise Lodge Deck\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e today from 11AM-2PM, featuring live music from DJ Preedy and cold drinks! Temperature here at the base lodge is currently -4 with winds of 3 kph NW. Up at the summit, the temperature is currently -10 with wind speeds of 3 kph SW.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eReminder: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eEarly-season hazards are still present, please ski and ride with care. Do not enter closed areas - they are closed for your safety and the safety of our Ski Patrol.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eUpcoming Events\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e - Sunday, February 15 - \u003c/span\u003e\u003cu style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(195, 32, 48);\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.redresort.com/olympics-at-rafters/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eOlympics at Rafters\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(37, 37, 37);\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e12PM Men’s Ice Hockey (USA|GER)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e - Sunday, February 15 - Live Music at \u003c/span\u003e\u003cu style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(195, 32, 48);\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.redresort.com/dining/#paradise\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eParadise Lodge\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e featuring DJ Preedy 11AM-2PM\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e - Monday, February 16 - \u003c/span\u003e\u003cu style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(195, 32, 48);\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.redresort.com/family-day-scavenger-hunt/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"\u0